What I Built:
A dashboard to track transaction status by team and date, showing settlement rates and exceptions.

What I Did:
Step 1: Set up data

Created "Transactions" sheet with 20 records

Columns: Date, TradeID, Team, Instrument, Status, Amount, Settlement_Date, Days_to_Settle, Comments

Step 2: Create Key Metrics

Total Transactions: 20

Settled: 12 (60%)

Pending: 5 (25%)

Failed: 3 (15%)

Used COUNTIF and COUNTA formulas

Step 3: Create 3 PivotTables

PivotTable 1: Status by Team

PivotTable 2: Status by Date (Daily Trend)

PivotTable 3: Settlement Rate by Team (% of Row Total)

Step 4: Add Charts

Bar Chart: Status by Team

Line Chart: Daily Status Trend

Pie Chart: Overall Status Distribution

Step 5: Build Dashboard

Combined all metrics and charts on one sheet

Mistakes I Made & How I Fixed Them:
Mistake 1: Wrong denominator for percentage

I did: Rate = Settled/Matched ❌

Fix: Rate = Settled/Total ✅

Mistake 2: Forgot to group dates in PivotTable

Problem: Dates showing individually

Fix: Right-click date → Group → Days

Mistake 3: Couldn't find "Show Values As"

Problem: Right-click on value field → Show Values As → % of Row Total

Fix: This shows each team's status percentage

Mistake 4: PivotTable not updating

Problem: Data changed but PivotTable didn't update

Fix: Right-click PivotTable → Refresh

